Package: cybroid-edition-network
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CybroidOS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://cybroid.com/cybroidos
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: cybroid-plasma (>= @VERSION@), wireshark, tshark, nmap, tcpdump, iperf3, mtr-tiny, traceroute, arping, ethtool, minicom, picocom, putty, snmp, ipcalc, sipcalc, ansible
Description: CybroidOS Network: for network engineers and students
 Capture, testing and console tools: Wireshark, Nmap, tcpdump, iperf3,
 mtr, traceroute and arping, serial consoles (minicom, picocom, PuTTY),
 SNMP tools, subnet calculators and Ansible. Pairs with the CIT platform's
 network labs.
 .
 The same CybroidOS as every edition (look, updates, Hangar), with these
 tools added. An installed CybroidOS becomes this edition by installing this
 package; several editions can be installed together.
